MANAGE PRODUCTS (choice 1)
  Input the product menu choice (1 Add product, 2 Restock product)
  IF the choice is Add product
    Input the product ID
    IF the product ID already exists in the inventory
      Display "Product ID already exists"
    ELSE
      Input the product name, price, and starting quantity
      IF the price is greater than 0 and the quantity is 0 or more
        Save the product with stock = quantity and units sold = 0
        Display "Product added"
      ELSE
        Display "Invalid price or quantity"
      END IF
    END IF
  ELSE IF the choice is Restock product
    Input the product ID
    IF the product does not exist in the inventory
      Display "Product not found"
    ELSE
      Input the number of units received
      IF the units are a whole number greater than 0
        Add the units to the stock and display the new amount
      ELSE
        Display "Enter a positive whole number"
      END IF
    END IF
  ELSE
    Display "Invalid choice"
  END IF
